  "summary": "<p>New Analysis Confirms President Trump’s Pro-Growth Policies Are Driving American Manufacturing Resurgence President Donald J. Trump’s America First agenda is revitalizing American manufacturing, delivering historic investments, driving up wages, and igniting a blue-collar BOOM. After the Biden Administration lost more than 200,000 American manufacturing jobs in its final two years due to reckless Democrat polices, [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/new-analysis-president-trumps-pro-growth-policies-ignite-manufacturing-resurgence/\">New Analysis: President Trump’s Pro-Growth Policies Ignite Manufacturing Resurgence</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
